<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Sales Cycle & Tax-Compliant Invoicing</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Unified sales management that bridges the gap between commercial negotiation and financial 
            settlement with precision and compliance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Frictionless Commercial Workflows</h2>
        <p>
            Experience a structured sales lifecycle that eliminates manual errors and re-keying. 
            Transform a Quotation into a Sales Order, generate a Delivery Note for the warehouse, 
            and finally issue a Tax-Compliant Invoice with a single integrated workflow. This 
            continuity ensured that the technical and commercial terms agreed upon by the 
            sales team are accurately reflected in the final financial transaction.
        </p>
        <p>
            Proforma invoicing support enables complex B2B and export transactions, providing 
            clients with the documentation required for advance payments and regulatory 
            clearances.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Intelligent Pricing and Discounting</h2>
        <p>
            Manage complex pricing models with ease. Define customer-specific price lists, quantity-based 
            volume breaks, and promotional discount rules that are automatically applied at the point 
            of sale. This system-level control ensures that sales representatives can only offer 
            authorized pricing, protecting margins and maintaining commercial consistency 
            across the enterprise.
        </p>
        <p>
            Multi-currency invoicing allows you to present balances in USD, ZiG, or other regional 
            currencies, accurately calculating VAT and other tax obligations according to 
            local regulations and the exchange rates prevailing at the time of supply.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Commercial Intelligence and Commission</h2>
        <p>
            Gain visibility into your sales performance with detailed backorder reports and 
            ageing sales orders. Sales representative commission tracking provides 
            authoritative data for incentive payouts, linking commissions directly 
            to successfully invoiced (and optionally paid) revenue.
        </p>
        <p>
            Full Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) and Credit Note workflows ensure 
            that commercial disputes and product returns are handled with professional 
            rigor, correctly adjusting both inventory ledgers and financial receivables 
            through an integrated audit trail.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

